{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_almond_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_almond_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"遠航","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_almond_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"223a1942775058a38387560482af862d8a3abf5acc4cf4194312895dcf3622f9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉？你對巴倫基地應該沒有那麼陌生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……抱歉，我有點出神……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你直直地盯著桌上的模型，我還以為它出了什麼問題呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽前輩們說，這個模型可是巴倫基地改造完成、交付使用時，工程隊專門製作的紀念品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它真的沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。它看上去……就和現在的基地一模一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼說我就放心了。那我們繼續？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備好了哦，等我看下你的報告……咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，收到追捕銀行劫匪的命令後，你採取了什麼行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我正帶領工程小隊再次確認地塊連接結構的穩固性，收到消息後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我選擇繼續手頭的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳述你如此行動的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接收到的命令是，除了參與地塊接洽工作的人員外，其他小隊開始追捕銀行劫匪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我判斷地塊接洽工作仍需要人手，而我們工程小隊本就需要加入其中，屬於相關人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我選擇聽從指令，不改變原先的接駁工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但根據報告上的內容，在實施銀行搶案的劫匪中，有一位是你在達維鎮的同伴。你當時清楚這一消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一消息，你當時的判斷是怎樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判斷……我的判斷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我不會重複第二遍。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的判斷……我沒做什麼判斷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我是黑鋼的雇員，奉命行事是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的職責。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（皺眉）……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“奉命行事，羅拉，你做出了正確的決定。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？羅拉，我學得還挺像那麼一回事的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有剛剛那句，“我不會重複第二遍”，簡直一模一樣是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……羅拉，怎麼了？你的臉色好像不太好。不會是……我給你的壓迫感太強了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的……我只是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託，我們繼續吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛……那就是最後一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，我必須得告訴你，從達維鎮回來以後，你就一直表現得有些心神不寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，那是一場非常特殊的行動，而那時候你恰好就處在漩渦的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的難以想像你經歷了什麼，但即便如此，你也不能一直這麼緊繃著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，現在的你需要的是休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休息……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且是好好休息。別再想行動報告的事了，你應該申請一個長假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對……我不能再這麼消沉下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿莉莎，陪我再來一遍，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉……你根本就沒有聽我說話……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，羅拉，你最好別去做這個行動報告了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經過去兩週了，沒人會再說起那件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不過是公司歷程中的一個小插曲而已，你做得再認真，主管肯定也只是裝模作樣地聽一聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位小姐說得很對，你還不如找主管去批個長假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……我得去做這次報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從一開始就到了達維鎮，很多事情是我親眼所見，親身經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在行動中執行命令，行動後做好行動報告，這都是黑鋼雇員的職責所在，更何況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿莉莎，你看到我在報告上寫的東西了吧？那些事情難道不應該被整理匯報上去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要報告，達維鎮發生的事情已經再清晰不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在完成政府委託任務的過程中，有一位黑鋼員工違規參與了犯罪活動，嚴重影響了公司的形象與聲譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，我們都清楚，這不是一件值得反覆提及的事情，尤其是在……兩週之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們靠薪資吃飯，只要奉命行事，保住自己的飯碗就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要讓自己那麼煩惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我還是要找人問清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡痛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"屁股痛沒事，長點教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道錯了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你不知道自己錯在哪裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃完飯，跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小羅拉，你這麼急著約我出來，有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，我有件事情想問問你的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是達維鎮的事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有這麼明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平時最會逗大家開心的小開心果出了趟門忽然變得悶悶不樂，猜不出來才比較難吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於達維鎮的事，我整理了一份報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告的話，雷蛇已經提交過一份了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，已經過去相當長一段時間了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我大概能猜到，那份報告裡寫了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以告訴你，如果你真的遞交上去會發生什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的報告會被無視，你的問題不會得到回答，如果收到你報告的人心情不好，說不定你還會挨一個處分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經過去兩週了，有時候我還是會想起鎮上的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上的情況我們都看到了，潔西卡為大家做了最多的事，還總覺得自己做得不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是一直都這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……芙蘭卡，我在達維鎮的表現，是不是很差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒看出來，小開心果的果仁裡，原來那麼富有正義感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是正義感的問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最後，你們至少能去找她，那個時候我在幹什麼呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在潔西卡被層層圍堵的危機關頭，我卻待在本艦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明當時……明明當時……我真的很想和她一起留下來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們穿著黑鋼的制服，聽從上頭的命令，有些事做不到並不是你的過錯。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們的雷蛇隊長在這裡，她一定會語重心長地這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，她大概會給你一個溫暖的擁抱，讓你感受到你在這艘艦船上並不是沒有依靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，難道你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是告訴你，你現在轉身去找雷蛇的話，或許能獲得更溫暖的建議和安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我這裡，你只會聽到一些刺耳的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小開心果，你呀，究竟是在後悔自己沒幫上潔西卡，還是在嫉妒潔西卡能做選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你寫的這份報告，是為了所謂的真相，還是為了說服自己，我並不是一個膽小鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我生在一個普通的家庭，母親是個普通醫生，可我的人生並沒有太多自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著家人一起搬家，離開玻利瓦爾去哥倫比亞。好不容易考上大學，快畢業時又染上了礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的科技公司都不要我，我能去的只有黑鋼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而來到這裡以後，我學會的第一件事，就是聽從指令，跟著隊伍行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在嫉妒她能做選擇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布林雷這個姓氏帶給潔西卡的負擔遠比帶給她的資源要多得多，這一點我們都看在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不羨慕她的財富，我知道，她肩上的東西比我多得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但正是因為這樣，我才不明白，為什麼潔西卡能夠做出選擇？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默凝固在她們之間。\n許久，棕髮的沃爾珀仰起腦袋，對著低垂的夜幕輕嘆了一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時，如果你和我們一起收到命令去追潔西卡，你會對她舉起銃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是命令呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不願意傷害她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣，你也做出了一次選擇，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這怎麼算——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又不像潔西卡那樣來自大戶人家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人物做個決定會影響許多人，我們小人物呢，做的決定能影響自己就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不可以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退一步說，承認自己只是不想當膽小鬼……比所謂的追求真相可要坦率多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相不重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對真相來說，有些時候，被記住比什麼都強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就這麼一說，你也就這麼一聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和雷蛇現在外派的那個叫羅德島的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要執行的任務雖然挺困難的，不過福利還不錯，而且，那邊的人還挺有人情味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有的小開心果覺得黑鋼的空氣不適合她的生長——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換個土壤也是個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，芙蘭卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，他們說這種煩惱找你就對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這是什麼說法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說，“芙蘭卡雖然嘴上不饒人，但是你有麻煩她一定會好好幫你解決的”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪個混帳東西壞我名聲？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你對那些機械設備感興趣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼不問問我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我不喜歡你擺弄那些零件，不希望你最後和你奶奶一樣，整天悶在工作車間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是你應該問問我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我很有可能拒絕你。但同樣，也會出現另一種可能性，另一個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不嘗試，就永遠不會有其他的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到那張桌子了嗎？以後那就是你的工作檯了，把你的東西都從床底下搬出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在就去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，找我有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我的上一個任務是達維鎮的……您應該知道那件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於那個任務，我按照慣例，寫了一份行動報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有這個慣例嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行動報告……哦，我想起來了，確實有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是件大任務，過程中也有不少波折。能整理成報告，辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒關係……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，你的報告一定能幫助我們補上許多關於事件的細節。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在羅拉的注視下，桌對面的人快速地翻閱了一下她的報告。\n然後嘆了口氣。\n不出她所料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的報告並不應該是這樣的，羅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是技術崗，報告裡不應該有和工程任務無關的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。但是，我在執行任務的過程中，並不只有工程相關的見聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能欺騙自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，反正也不會有人看到這份報告，就這樣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他翻到了報告的最後一頁，在上面流暢地簽下了自己的姓名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的職業生涯還很長，羅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要學會判斷自己看到了什麼，又沒看到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，主管，我只是個工程人員，對這方面實在不算很了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我有一個請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，申請參與新一輪的交流項目，調派去羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，那我們繼續啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等等等，我還沒有準備好，等我再整理一下情緒……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，好了，開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……你腰間玩偶的來歷是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我腰間玩偶的……什麼玩意？這真的是面試問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯啊，這本芙蘭卡給的《面試題目大合集》中寫著的，“偶爾會對面試者的穿著裝飾提出問題”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧……我的玩偶，是我媽媽給我做的，我一直帶在身邊。這樣夠不夠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒達到平均時長，但是應該夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你前面已經過了那麼多堪稱恐怖的測試……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡不是說了嗎，只要前面的測試都過了，面試不過就是聊聊天。我看你也不用準備什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，要確保萬無一失。快，下一題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題看上去還挺可靠的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小羅拉！我來找你玩啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，在準備羅德島的面試嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你已經想得很清楚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然。噓，一會再聊，等我先回答完這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，關於你的未來，你有什麼想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的未來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的……未來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太危險了，寶貝，我們不能再待下去了。我不能讓你在戰火中長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，媽媽也不想這樣，但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的命運，大部分時候都不由我們自己決定，我……沒有選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的……羅拉，寶貝，是的。你是我的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。今後，我們會到新的地方，你會看見一些新鮮事，遇見一些新的人，有一大片新的命運等待著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，你也會再次面對這樣看起來別無他路的困境，不知道未來將去往何方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候，你只要記得，堅持走下去，你就會發現，選擇其實就在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而這一次，你會有足夠的勇氣，去做出決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
